        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Script to Narrated Clip\n\nTurns a written line into narration and a described scene into footage, then combines them into one clip. Generating voice and picture separately lets you redo one without paying for the other.\n\n**How it works:** \"Script\" feeds \"Voice\", a text-to-speech node. \"Scene\" feeds \"Footage\", which renders 6 seconds of 16:9 video at 720p. \"Lay voice over\" replaces the clip's audio with the narration, and \"Clip\" returns the finished video.\n\n**Try this:** Pick models on \"Voice\" and \"Footage\", then rewrite only \"Script\" and rerun to hear a new line over a scene you like."
        },
